OL,3,C'Brutal' harvest could be worst on
OL,4,Crecord because of extreme summer `
OL,5,Canalysis
OL,7,FFarmers are warning the extreme summer
OL,8,Fhas been "completely brutal" as
OL,9,Fanalysis suggests 2026 could be the
OL,10,Fworst harvest on record.
OL,12,FAnalysis by the Energy and Climate
OL,13,FIntelligence Unit (ECIU) suggests the
OL,14,Fexceptionally hot, dry spring and
OL,15,Fsummer could have cut the country's
OL,16,Fcereals and oilseed harvest by 2.5
OL,17,Fmillion tonnes compared to earlier
OL,18,Fforecasts.
OL,20,FThe shortfall could be costing UK
OL,21,Ffarmers as much as #390 million.
OL,26,@pD@JOUpD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
